                "text": "Americans are facing a healthcare crisis, and those who question the current orthodoxy or offer alternative treatments are ridiculed, vilified, and canceled.\n\nYesterday, I was joined by a highly qualified group of doctors and nutritional experts to discuss our nation's health and ask questions we haven't been allowed to ask.",
