                "text": "The uniparty has deviously converted discretionary into mandatory spending \u2013 enabling them to spend a lot more.\n\nMy chart shows Other Mandatory Spending (OMS) has increased $681B since FY2019 \u2013 almost as much as Social Security, Medicare, and Medicaid combined.\n\n@DOGE should seriously look at the $1.3T in OSM for signification savings.",
