                "text": "If we use @POTUS\u2019s projected FY2025 outlays, plus Biden\u2019s projected FY2025 spending for Social Security, Medicare, and Interest, then FY2025 outlays would equal $6.1 trillion. \n\nThis will dramatically reduce the deficit, and put us in a position where actually balancing the budget is entirely doable.",
